    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectReached? THEN\n\t\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tDO CheckObjectWeight\n\t\t\t\t\tDO MoveToEndLocation\n\t\t\t\t\tDO PlaceObject\n\t\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
